  "id": "USN-8583-1",
  "summary": "giflib vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that GIFLIB incorrectly handled certain GIF image files.\nIf a user or automated system were tricked into opening a specially crafted\nGIF file, a remote attacker could use this issue to cause GIFLIB to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or possibly execute arbitrary code.",
